Archivo, Inter, and Unbounded are used under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1.
The license text for Archivo is OFL-Archivo.txt.
The license text for Inter is OFL-Inter.txt.
The license text for Unbounded is OFL-Unbounded.txt.
The WOFF2 files are subset variable fonts. Archivo is used at width 125 on the home page.
Inter-Variable.woff2 is the same file on every page (weights 100–900).
Unbounded-Variable.woff2 is the latin subset used for the wordmark and the thank-you kicker (weights 200–900).
